# Independent pristine card4-slot16, Magatsu Inaba's final fixed field: Adachi's defeat.
# The camp menu sets Yu's Persona to roster slot 1 (ID 2: Ziodyne, Repel Elec); the walker's battle rules
# then fight Adachi: Balm of Life for any downed member, Yukiko's Me Patra on fear (Ghastly Wail), a Bead
# Chain under 250 HP, Guard while Adachi is charged, otherwise Ziodyne (Yu, Kanji), Agidyne (Yukiko) and
# Bufudyne (Teddie). Skills and items are chosen by native ID, not cursor history.
# Ends at Ameno-sagiri's first COMMAND; it does not certify earlier floors or Ameno-sagiri's defeat.
